{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x05---sideshow-bob-roberts",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x05 - Sideshow Bob Roberts",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x05 - Sideshow Bob Roberts.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:00.814Z",
  "lineCount": 283,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Sideshow Bob Roberts",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 13830,
      "endMs": 15837
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "No sports, no rock No information For mindless chatter We're your station KBBL talk radio. Now Springfield's favorite conservative...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 22707,
      "endMs": 30599
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "...author of well-selling book Only Turkeys Have Left Wings...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 30735,
      "endMs": 33660
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "...ladies and gentlemen, Birch Barlow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33796,
      "endMs": 36721
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "That Barlow's a right-wing crackpot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38864,
      "endMs": 41143
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He said Ted Kennedy lacked integrity. Can you believe that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 41347,
      "endMs": 44544
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Yeah, switch the station. I consider myself politically correct.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44680,
      "endMs": 47844
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "His views make me uncomfortable.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47980,
      "endMs": 49952
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "No, no, no, guys. Now, I'm not very political.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 50122,
      "endMs": 52946
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "I usually think people who vote are a bit fruity.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53116,
      "endMs": 56075
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "But for some reason, this Birch Barlow really speaks to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56245,
      "endMs": 60293
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Good morning, freedom-likers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65701,
      "endMs": 67129
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Birch Barlow, the fourth branch of government, the 51st state.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67299,
      "endMs": 70259
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "You know, there are three things we'll never get rid of in Springfield: One, the bats in the public library.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70463,
      "endMs": 75939
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Two, Mrs. McFearley's compost heap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77571,
      "endMs": 79918
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "And three, our six-term mayor...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83864,
      "endMs": 86721
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "...the illiterate, tax-cheating, pot-smoking spend-o-crat...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86857,
      "endMs": 90463
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "...Diamond Joe Quimby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90633,
      "endMs": 92810
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Hey, I am no longer illiterate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92980,
      "endMs": 94816
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Now, why are we doomed to this Quimby quagmire, you ask...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 95054,
      "endMs": 98218
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "...O reasonable listener?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98388,
      "endMs": 100054
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Because this town is under the stranglehold...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100224,
      "endMs": 102333
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "...of a few tie-dyed \"tree-huggers\"...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102503,
      "endMs": 104986
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "...who'd rather play Hacky Sack than lock up the homeless.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105122,
      "endMs": 107299
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "This sounds awfully controversial.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108524,
      "endMs": 111109
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Lisa, you know I don't like controversy in this house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 111279,
      "endMs": 114340
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "I don't like him either...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 114544,
      "endMs": 115803
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "...but I'm doing a report on local politics for my school project.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115973,
      "endMs": 119034
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "You think you're so big because your class always gets to do projects.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119204,
      "endMs": 122741
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Well, I'm doing a school project on fireworks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122912,
      "endMs": 128660
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Bart, I wish you wouldn't lie like that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129476,
      "endMs": 131789
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Now, as a special sendoff and a way to say...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133728,
      "endMs": 136517
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "...to our visiting Chinese principals...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138184,
      "endMs": 140259
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "...Bart Simpson has promised us a fireworks display.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140429,
      "endMs": 143320
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Cool. Cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144340,
      "endMs": 146415
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "What a week. He promise a big firework display.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149136,
      "endMs": 151551
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Bad student. Bad principal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151687,
      "endMs": 154952
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "So, my friends, let's just junk those dumb-o-crats...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156891,
      "endMs": 159748
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "...and their bleeding-heart smell-fare program.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159884,
      "endMs": 162333
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I had to listen to this jerk all morning. Can we listen to something else?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162503,
      "endMs": 165939
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "When I'm driving the car, I get to choose the radio station.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166109,
      "endMs": 169476
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "When you're driving, we'll listen to your radio station.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 169646,
      "endMs": 173796
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "I can't take this anymore. Let's switch back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 178762,
      "endMs": 180939
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Let's go to the phones. First up is Bob from South Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181143,
      "endMs": 184272
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Welcome to you, sir. Hello, Birch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184442,
      "endMs": 186381
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Long-time listener, first-time caller.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 186551,
      "endMs": 188422
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Kudos for bringing the \"public\" back to the Republican Party.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188626,
      "endMs": 193082
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "It's time people realized we conservatives aren't all Johnny Hatemongers...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 193252,
      "endMs": 196823
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "...and Charlie Bible-Thumps or even, God forbid, George Bushes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197027,
      "endMs": 200531
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "That sounds like Sideshow Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201177,
      "endMs": 203116
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Yes, ma'am. Sideshow Bob, yakking it up on the old yak box.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203286,
      "endMs": 208252
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "I'll spare you the embarrassment of admitting you don't know who Bob is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208422,
      "endMs": 212469
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Sideshow Bob used to be Krusty the Clown's sidekick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213728,
      "endMs": 216177
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "But in 1990, he framed Krusty for armed robbery, and Bart got him put in jail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216347,
      "endMs": 220905
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "When he got out, he married Aunt Selma and tried to murder her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221075,
      "endMs": 224136
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Oh, Sideshow Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224374,
      "endMs": 226857
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Bart, your mortal enemy is on the radio.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227027,
      "endMs": 229476
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "It's time for more dementia with Dr. Demento.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229680,
      "endMs": 234544
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "And now the Funny 5...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235973,
      "endMs": 238252
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "I meant your other mortal enemy. Sideshow Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238864,
      "endMs": 243320
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Sideshow Bob?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243728,
      "endMs": 245905
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "I'm only 10, and I already got two mortal enemies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246415,
      "endMs": 249102
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "And this proposed expressway will bring increased commerce...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249952,
      "endMs": 253490
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "...to our local merchants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253626,
      "endMs": 255156
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "What's in it for us?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 256891,
      "endMs": 258150
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Give us something we like, or we'll ride you out of town on a rail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258320,
      "endMs": 261449
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Well, what do you people like?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261823,
      "endMs": 264068
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Sleep. Sexy dames, and plenty of them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264238,
      "endMs": 266279
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Matlock!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266483,
      "endMs": 269714
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Well, I suppose I could name it the Matlock Expressway.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269947,
      "endMs": 275420
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "But it would be terribly myopic of me to blame all my current woes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 278424,
      "endMs": 282395
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "...on one spiky-haired little simpleton.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282562,
      "endMs": 286133
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Myopic or, to say the least, intransigent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286366,
      "endMs": 288969
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Now, you mentioned some woes there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289136,
      "endMs": 291406
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Well, you see, Birch, I'm presently incarcerated.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291539,
      "endMs": 295377
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Convicted of a crime I didn't even commit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298047,
      "endMs": 301284
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Attempted murder. Now, honestly, what is that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 301884,
      "endMs": 304588
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Do they give a Nobel Prize for attempted chemistry? Do they?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304754,
      "endMs": 308025
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Oh, really. Now, this is a personal call.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308826,
      "endMs": 311229
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Now, my friends, isn't this just typical?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311429,
      "endMs": 314266
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Another intelligent conservative here railroaded by our liberal justice system.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314466,
      "endMs": 319171
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Just like Colonel Oliver North, Officer Stacey Koon...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319338,
      "endMs": 323877
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "...and cartoon smokesperson Joe Camel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 324010,
      "endMs": 326213
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Well, I've had it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327581,
      "endMs": 328816
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I am gonna make it my mission to see that our friend Bob is set free.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 328949,
      "endMs": 333588
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 333788,
      "endMs": 335524
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Well, despite Bart's objections, the people of South Africa...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336992,
      "endMs": 340162
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "...can now vote in free democratic elections.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340329,
      "endMs": 342532
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "My friends, Bob is a political prisoner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342699,
      "endMs": 346103
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "I want every loyal listener to do everything they can...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346270,
      "endMs": 349607
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "...to get him out of jail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349740,
      "endMs": 351576
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "All right, you heard the man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351709,
      "endMs": 353111
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "One grenade each.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353778,
      "endMs": 355714
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Moe, I think he meant through nonviolent, grassroots political action.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356248,
      "endMs": 361187
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Oh, Jeez. Really? You think so?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361354,
      "endMs": 363723
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "All right, give them back. Come on. Everybody, give them back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 363890,
      "endMs": 367094
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Hey. Hey! Who pulled the pin on this one?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367194,
      "endMs": 369630
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Very well, if that is the way the winds are blowing...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 372934,
      "endMs": 375470
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "...let no one say I don't also blow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375604,
      "endMs": 378140
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Free Bob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378340,
      "endMs": 379608
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "By special order of the mayor of Springfield...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379775,
      "endMs": 382912
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "...you are hereby granted a full and complete pardon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383079,
      "endMs": 386016
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Congratulations, Robert Underdunk Terwilliger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386183,
      "endMs": 390221
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Boat's on the other side. Yes, thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 395293,
      "endMs": 398264
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Hail, brothers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417122,
      "endMs": 418490
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Now, then, gentlemen, the mayoral campaign is upon us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 423062,
      "endMs": 426533
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "If we hope to defeat Joe Quimby...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426700,
      "endMs": 428402
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "...we need a candidate with name recognition and media savvy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428569,
      "endMs": 431672
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "A true leader who will do exactly as he's told.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431872,
      "endMs": 434876
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Monty, I'm way ahead of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435043,
      "endMs": 436711
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "If you'll just open that door, you'll see the next mayor of Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436878,
      "endMs": 441050
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Nice. Very nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444387,
      "endMs": 446523
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "What did it say? No, no. Bob. Bob, come in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447724,
      "endMs": 451095
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "A fine mahoq to you all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452697,
      "endMs": 455367
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Why, he's even better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455500,
      "endMs": 456935
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "I agree. I like the human touch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457069,
      "endMs": 460005
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "I want you on your best behavior for this choreographed media event.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463276,
      "endMs": 466446
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "There is to be no wising off...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466613,
      "endMs": 468315
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "...no face-making and no grass-eating. This means you, Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468482,
      "endMs": 471752
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Yes, sir. Hello, children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471919,
      "endMs": 473988
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Hello, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474189,
      "endMs": 475223
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Friends, my opponent, Joe Quimby, is confused about your school system.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476358,
      "endMs": 480729
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Do you know what he does? He flip-flops.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480896,
      "endMs": 483466
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Sometimes he doesn't know whether he's coming or going.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487604,
      "endMs": 491609
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "He wants to sell your future short.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495280,
      "endMs": 498250
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Bart, we can't let Bob steal the spotlight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504057,
      "endMs": 506226
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "We'll have to stoop to the lowest common denominator.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506359,
      "endMs": 508996
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "I can do that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509163,
      "endMs": 510197
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Help! I'm being attacked by things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511599,
      "endMs": 514936
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Uncle Mayor was just saying that us kids...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516938,
      "endMs": 518974
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "...are the most important natural resource we have.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519141,
      "endMs": 521978
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "More important than coal?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522144,
      "endMs": 523446
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524614,
      "endMs": 526383
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Oh, that was a big mistake, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529820,
      "endMs": 532924
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "No children have ever meddled with the Republican Party...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533224,
      "endMs": 535760
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "...and lived to tell about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535894,
      "endMs": 537429
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Stay out of Riverdale.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 548642,
      "endMs": 550244
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Without Mayor Quimby Our town would really stink We wouldn't have a tire yard Or a mid-sized roller rink We wouldn't have our gallows Or a shiny Bigfoot trap It's not the mayor's fault That the stadium collapsed Quimby. If you were running for mayor, he'd vote for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552880,
      "endMs": 568899
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Paid for by the Mayor Quimby Committee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 569066,
      "endMs": 570935
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Hey, four-eyes, vote Quimby. Hey, beard-o, vote Quimby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571068,
      "endMs": 574873
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "This time, he's the lesser of two evils.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 575040,
      "endMs": 577376
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, I love Grimby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577542,
      "endMs": 579745
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Could I have some more bumper stickers, please, dude?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580346,
      "endMs": 583483
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 587888,
      "endMs": 589390
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "The mummy's ready for his mystical journey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589590,
      "endMs": 593494
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "What's happening?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 594863,
      "endMs": 597399
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Mayor Quimby supports revolving-door prisons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 597551,
      "endMs": 601155
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Mayor Quimby even released Sideshow Bob...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601288,
      "endMs": 604859
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "...a man twice convicted of attempted murder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605026,
      "endMs": 608263
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Can you trust a man like Mayor Quimby?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608397,
      "endMs": 611200
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Vote Sideshow Bob for mayor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611367,
      "endMs": 612568
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "The League of Uninformed Voters presents the Springfield mayoral debates.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 615705,
      "endMs": 619843
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "I'm your moderator, Larry King. Now a word to our audience.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620010,
      "endMs": 622913
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Even though we're being broadcast on Fox...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623114,
      "endMs": 625784
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "...there's no need for obnoxious hooting and hollering.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626017,
      "endMs": 628587
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "I shouldn't have shaken hands with those old people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638699,
      "endMs": 642269
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "I hope that flu doesn't affect his performance out there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646641,
      "endMs": 649311
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Don't worry. He's taken a million of these capsules.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649478,
      "endMs": 652014
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Sideshow Bob, Councilman Les Wynan...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 658388,
      "endMs": 661292
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "...says that you're not experienced enough to be mayor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 661458,
      "endMs": 664729
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Sir, what do you have to say about that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664862,
      "endMs": 666698
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I'd say that Les Wynan ought to do more thinking and less whining.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666865,
      "endMs": 672505
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "There's no Councilman Les Wynan. Good line, though.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675275,
      "endMs": 678612
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Mayor Quimby, you are well known, sir, for your lenient stance on crime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678779,
      "endMs": 683651
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "But suppose for a second that your house was ransacked by thugs...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683818,
      "endMs": 687255
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "...your family tied up in the basement with socks in their mouths.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687422,
      "endMs": 690626
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "You try to open the door, but there's too much blood on the knob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690793,
      "endMs": 694230
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "What is your question? My question's about the budget.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694397,
      "endMs": 697167
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "I don't agree with his Bart-killing policy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 710916,
      "endMs": 714187
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "...but I do approve of his Selma-killing policy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714620,
      "endMs": 718358
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Well, he framed me for armed robbery...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718625,
      "endMs": 720928
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "...but, man, I'm aching for that upper-class tax cut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721128,
      "endMs": 724599
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "And the results are in. For Sideshow Bob, 100 percent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729605,
      "endMs": 733075
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "For Joe Quimby, 1 percent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733242,
      "endMs": 734544
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "And we remind you, there is a 1-percent margin of error.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 734711,
      "endMs": 737314
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "All right, let's go live to Bob headquarters now...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742887,
      "endMs": 745290
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "...for Mayor Terwilliger's victory speech.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745523,
      "endMs": 747793
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "And just look how happy he is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760174,
      "endMs": 763144
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "It's the rapture!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774025,
      "endMs": 775627
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Quick, get Bart out of the house before God comes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 775828,
      "endMs": 778431
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "So sorry, Mr. Simpson. Your house is blocking construction...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781467,
      "endMs": 784237
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "...of our new Matlock Expressway.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784404,
      "endMs": 786073
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Now, I am a fair man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788442,
      "endMs": 790111
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "You will have 72 hours to vacate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 790244,
      "endMs": 792313
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "At that time, we will blow up your house and any remaining Simpsons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792480,
      "endMs": 796051
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Homer, we've got to stop them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796218,
      "endMs": 798354
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "I know what you're up to, Mayor Terwigager...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 798521,
      "endMs": 801024
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "...and no one in my family's gonna stand for it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 801190,
      "endMs": 804227
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Move your goddurn house, son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 805229,
      "endMs": 807431
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Bart, by special request of the mayor's office, you are going to be left back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810501,
      "endMs": 815507
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "You mean I have to repeat the fourth grade?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816542,
      "endMs": 818911
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Well, yes. But not for four or five years. Bart, you're going to kindergarten.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 819078,
      "endMs": 822749
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Kindergarten?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822949,
      "endMs": 824685
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Now, boys and girls, who knows what this is?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 825853,
      "endMs": 829223
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Triangle. Very good, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 829423,
      "endMs": 831759
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "You have first choice of toys for free play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831926,
      "endMs": 834529
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Cool. I call the Flintstone phone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834663,
      "endMs": 836365
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "I like talking to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840169,
      "endMs": 842105
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "We're gonna lose our house and end up living under a bridge like common trolls.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845475,
      "endMs": 849280
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "I don't think Bob won that election legally.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849447,
      "endMs": 851583
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I can't believe a convicted felon would get so many votes...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851749,
      "endMs": 854453
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "...and another convicted felon would get so few.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854586,
      "endMs": 856755
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Here you go. The results of last month's mayor election.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860793,
      "endMs": 864598
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "All 48,000 voters and who each one of them voted for.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864765,
      "endMs": 867167
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "I thought this was a secret ballot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867334,
      "endMs": 869604
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Okay, Aaron A. Aaronson voted for...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875677,
      "endMs": 879315
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "...Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 879482,
      "endMs": 881084
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Aaron L. Aaronson voted for...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881217,
      "endMs": 883620
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "...Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883787,
      "endMs": 885622
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Arthur B. Ablabab voted for...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885789,
      "endMs": 888826
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "...Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 889026,
      "endMs": 890762
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Whoever wrote that note wants to meet us here tonight?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905479,
      "endMs": 908015
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "This is so cool, Bart. We're just like Woodward and Bernstein.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908182,
      "endMs": 911753
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Except their dad wasn't waiting in the car reading Archie Comics.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911920,
      "endMs": 914957
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Stuck-up Riverdale punks. Think they're too good for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915123,
      "endMs": 918361
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "You're on the right track. Follow the names.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920463,
      "endMs": 923133
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "How the hell do you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923266,
      "endMs": 925469
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "I can't tell you who I am, but I worked on the campaign.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927471,
      "endMs": 932310
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Hey, Mr. Smithers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933945,
      "endMs": 936181
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Well, you might as well give me a ride home now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936382,
      "endMs": 939519
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "I've never gone behind Mr. Burns' back before...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939886,
      "endMs": 942389
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "...but Sideshow Bob's ultra-conservative views...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942589,
      "endMs": 945058
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "...conflict with my choice of lifestyle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945225,
      "endMs": 948496
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "All I can do is give you one name. Edgar Neubauer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949931,
      "endMs": 952767
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Find him, and you'll find your answer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 952934,
      "endMs": 955370
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "No Edgar Neubauer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961311,
      "endMs": 963947
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "This is hopeless. They're gonna demolish our house for sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971956,
      "endMs": 974660
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "We're gonna have to move into a Motel 6.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974860,
      "endMs": 977062
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "But Dad can't afford 6 dollars a night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977229,
      "endMs": 980133
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Hey. Lis. Lis, come here. I found him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980400,
      "endMs": 984104
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "I found Edgar Neubauer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984304,
      "endMs": 985772
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Oh, my God. The dead have risen, and they're voting Republican.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988676,
      "endMs": 992347
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "No, Bart. Don't you see? Dead people can't vote.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992514,
      "endMs": 995183
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Look, \"Prudence Goodwyfe. Died, 1641.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996785,
      "endMs": 1000490
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "She voted for Bob too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000657,
      "endMs": 1002425
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "So did Buddy Holly, Richie Valens, and the Big Bopper.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1002692,
      "endMs": 1005662
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Even the pet cemetery voted for Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007097,
      "endMs": 1009333
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Look. Mr. And Mrs. Bananas, Humphrey Boa-gart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009534,
      "endMs": 1013071
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Oh, my poor dead kitty, please, not you too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1013271,
      "endMs": 1017209
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "All right, Bob, now it's personal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1018811,
      "endMs": 1022115
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Hey. He did try to kill me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022282,
      "endMs": 1025485
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Mr. Mayor, is it true you rigged the election?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052884,
      "endMs": 1056321
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "No, I did not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056488,
      "endMs": 1058391
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Kids, help.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1059158,
      "endMs": 1061027
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Oh, I don't mind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062662,
      "endMs": 1063997
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "We want these children to feel justice has been served.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064131,
      "endMs": 1067234
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "That way, they can sleep soundly tonight on their hard, feculent motel pillows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067434,
      "endMs": 1073475
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Well, Bart, Lisa, here I am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073909,
      "endMs": 1078013
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "I have a plan. I think we can trap him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1078247,
      "endMs": 1081584
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "You know, Sideshow Bob, I believe you when you say you're innocent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086357,
      "endMs": 1089560
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Indeed, I am. Because we all know...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089794,
      "endMs": 1091529
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "...you're a naive pawn, puppet, if you will...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091629,
      "endMs": 1094232
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "...of the most diabolical political genius Springfield has ever known: Birchibald T. Barlow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094399,
      "endMs": 1101007
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Wait...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103177,
      "endMs": 1105080
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "You don't have the intelligence to rig an election by yourself, do you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105246,
      "endMs": 1108750
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "You were just Barlow's lackey. You were Ronnie to his Nancy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108917,
      "endMs": 1111821
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Sonny to his Cher. Ringo to his rest of the Beatles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1112021,
      "endMs": 1114791
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Enough! Lies, lies! I did it! I did it all!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1114958,
      "endMs": 1119997
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "There. Is that what you want, you smarmy little bastards?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121966,
      "endMs": 1126471
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "We want the truth. You want the truth?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126605,
      "endMs": 1129041
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "You can't handle the truth. No truth-handler, you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1129208,
      "endMs": 1133212
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "I deride your truth-handling abilities.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133947,
      "endMs": 1137617
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Will you get to the point? Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1137818,
      "endMs": 1139787
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Only I could have executed such a masterpiece of electoral fraud.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1139954,
      "endMs": 1144659
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "And I have the records to prove it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1144793,
      "endMs": 1146495
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Here, just look at these. Each one a work of Machiavellian art.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1146661,
      "endMs": 1152201
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "But why? Because you need me, Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154871,
      "endMs": 1158909
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Your guilty conscience may force you to vote Democratic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159109,
      "endMs": 1162580
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "But deep down inside, you secretly long for a cold-hearted Republican...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1162713,
      "endMs": 1166218
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "...to lower taxes, brutalize criminals and rule you like a king.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1166418,
      "endMs": 1169788
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "That's why I did this. To protect you from yourselves.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1169955,
      "endMs": 1173526
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Now, if you don't mind, I have a city to run.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1173993,
      "endMs": 1175495
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Bailiffs, place the mayor under arrest. What? Oh, yes, all that stuff I did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177597,
      "endMs": 1181802
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Bart, we did it. Now we get to keep our house...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183571,
      "endMs": 1186041
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "...and you get to go back to the fourth grade.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1186174,
      "endMs": 1188677
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "Tomorrow we were gonna find out who the dish ran away with.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188844,
      "endMs": 1191647
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "The spoon, Bart. Of course.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1191781,
      "endMs": 1194717
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Someday, I'll have my vengeance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199490,
      "endMs": 1202126
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Someday, when I find my way out of this savage, roach-ridden cesspool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202293,
      "endMs": 1207165
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Say, Terwilliger's a Yalie. Bob, come along.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1208767,
      "endMs": 1211837
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "We need an eighth to row against the Princeton alums.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1211971,
      "endMs": 1215108
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Princeton?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1215308,
      "endMs": 1216877
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Stroke. Stroke. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1219947,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
